# Beorn, Reluctant Host // Till and Tend (CR 715): "You may play an additional land this turn." On turn 1 Bot1 plays a Forest, casts
# Till and Tend for {1}{G} from its two Moxen, then plays a Plains as its second land; a third land is refused (exactly one
# additional land, CR 305.2). The Adventure card goes to exile, not the graveyard. On turn 3 the effect has ended (until end of turn):
# one Plains is played and the next refused, and Beorn, a 5/5 with trample, is cast from exile for {4}{G} (the pool empty after).

